4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IZp2BbMIeGIQ7kNvwG8igJc&_nc_oc=AdqpZX39TLFIo1FaVp7Kqr0o94jyGKZYmLBrgR96MAO5BpacRtLk2RSaQwCFAElVZts&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKV-4M0Oscn2znn4bnNBLtXzbY5K7CGwoRw9Zm-_HmVKA&oe=6AA69F54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kjbqlEiklssQ7kNvwFuXdvX&_nc_oc=Adqlp7oJQWHyFay7a2k3uuqQzfX8atHeNDxas_jnS1Wg9RZWNybHTLm81AQlDdI9zUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6Mi_uV4XM4gUqV9GN50MWUjG62FW6E6Rdscb3dec3oQ&oe=6AA6A432"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZgLgpXn-6u0Q7kNvwEBhMUI&_nc_oc=Adrg8Ww51j2FOfAOjYJJU30tcMGBN0ruhnSH-ZJcxtL1uBd5NhqJPvxjexjBZi3ti4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJ66ozi5VqpUrlQP8-b3fCUtXEfNgmHxHraO4gLx8pvSg&oe=6AA6B1D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p